    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      239.83,
      288.35,
      359.84,
      297.21
    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      307.99,
      455.89,
      336.86
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 34 of the National Authority on Tobacco andAlcohol Act, No.27 of 2006 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and thelegal effect of the section as amended is to\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      160.39,
      347.59,
      455.84,
      366.5
    ],
    "text": "(a)extend the prohibition imposed under section 34 to importers and the personswho supply, distribute and store tobacco products;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      160.39,
      377.23,
      455.87,
      406.1
    ],
    "text": "(b)remove the provisions which enable to specify by way of regulations the dimensionof the health warnings to be displayed on the packets, packages and cartons oftobacco products;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.11,
      416.83,
      384.35,
      425.9
    ],
    "text": "(c)increase the fine imposed on an offender under section 34.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      436.63,
      455.87,
      455.66
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause inserts new section 34A in the principal enactment and the legaleffect of the section is to specify the manner in which the health warnings to be displayed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      466.39,
      455.79,
      485.3
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4 : This clause amends section 45 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof that section is to insert a definition for the expression \u201chealth warnings\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      496.03,
      455.84,
      524.9
    ],
    "text": "Clause 5 : This clause grants a grace period up to June 1, 2015 to the manufacturers andimporters of existing stocks of tobacco products to comply with the provisions of section34A.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      535.63,
      455.88,
      564.5
    ],
    "text": "Clause 6 : This clause provides for the continuous operation of the regulations madeprior to the date of operation of the amending Act under section 30 read with section 34 ofthe principal enactment in so far as is not inconsistent with this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      191.49,
      167.17,
      402.89,
      190.24
