  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      253.85,
      401.9,
      276.83
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      286.25,
      401.87,
      309.23
    ],
    "text": "1.(1) This Act may be cited as the National Authorityon Tobacco and Alcohol (Amendment) Act, No. of 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      321.29,
      401.86,
      344.39
    ],
    "text": "(2) The provisions of this Act shall be deemed to havecome into operation with effect from February 1, 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      356.45,
      401.92,
      402.83
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 34 of the National Authority on the Tobaccoand Alcohol Act, No. 27 of 2006 (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cprincipale enactment\u201d) is hereby repealed and thefollowing section substituted therefor:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      409.25,
      401.89,
      549.23
    ],
    "text": "34 (1) A manufacturer or an importer of atobacco product shall cause to be displayedconspicuously and in legible print on the topsurface area of bothe front and back sides ofevery packet, package or carton containing thetobacco product manufactured or imported bysuch manufacturer or importer, a lable or astatement specifying the tar and nicotinecontent in each tobacco product in such packet,package or carton along with such healthwarnings, as may be prescribed, subject tosection 34A.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      555.65,
      401.9,
      672.95
    ],
    "text": "(2) A person shall not sell, offer for sale,supply, distribute or store a packet, package orcarton containing tobacco products unless astatement containing the tar and nicotinecontent and the health warnings are displayedconspicuously in legible print on the topsurface area of both front and back sides ofevery packet, package or carton containingthe tobocco product, as provided for insubsection (1).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
