      319.73,
      400.45,
      354.47
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 45 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the insertion immedialely after the definitionof the expression \u201cChairman\u201d of the following definition:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
